messages:
maria (AE): Hey team — BigBank POC kickoff. They want streaming responses + function/tool-calls + strict structured JSON output. Also flagged security questionnaire and pricing for sustained streaming. Can SE/eng weigh in on integration pattern and known blockers?

devon (SE): Quick notes: streaming SDK supports partial events + function call events. Biggest integration gotchas are (1) schema enforcement on the app side, (2) handling mid-stream function triggers, (3) retry semantics if connection drops.

james (Eng): +1. Example pattern we recommend: stream tokens to UI, but buffer function call triggers until the call is fully emitted. If you need strict JSON per response, use our structured-output mode which emits a final JSON object in the last event.

maria (AE): They want the function call to be executed as soon as the model emits it (financial txn enrichment). Concern: latency + at-most-once execution.

devon (SE): For at-most-once you should implement idempotency on the function side. We can emit a deterministic call_id in the streaming event. Example event snippet:
```
{
  "type": "function_call",
  "name": "enrich_account",
  "call_id": "<uuid>",
  "args": {"acct_id": "123"}
}
```
We can add call_id to the SDK response if they want.

maria (AE): Is that new? BigBank asked if we can guarantee call_id in all streaming events.

james (Eng): We already surface function_call chunks in streaming; adding call_id is a small API extension we can enable for the POC. Need a short RFC but doable.

presales-bot: Security questionnaire link posted: https://redwood.internal/q/BB-SEC-Q1 (answers partially filled).

sachin (SRE): Blockers from infra/security: BigBank requires VPC-only control plane + KMS integration for tenant key wrapping. For POC we can offer Dedicated or Private. Hosted API won't meet their policy. Also need IP allowlist and audit logs retention 365d.

ellen (Prod): Pricing note for the AE — sustained streaming (~200 concurrent streams, avg 1.2k tokens/min) is much cheaper on Dedicated reserved capacity. For hosted, streaming is billed per-token + connection overhead. I can run a cost estimate if you give me expected token volumes.

maria (AE): They'll provide expected daily token volume next biz day. For now, can we do a minimal demo that shows: streaming -> function_call with call_id -> final structured JSON output validated against a schema?

devon (SE): Yes. Plan: 1) small SDK demo repo (we'll fork a sample) with streaming client showing call_id + function call handler 2) include schema validation step using our structured-output mode 3) run PoC on Dedicated sandbox with KMS + IP allowlist 4) security team completes questionnaire and we map gaps.

james (Eng): I'll spin the SDK branch. Streaming sample (JS) — minimal:
```js
const stream = client.responses.stream({ model: 'rwd-stream-1', input: prompt });
for await (const ev of stream) {
  if (ev.type === 'function_call') {
    // ev.call_id available
    await callEnrichService(ev.call_id, ev.name, ev.args);
  }
  if (ev.type === 'structured_output' && ev.complete) {
    validateAgainstSchema(ev.json);
  }
}
```

maria (AE): Nice. BigBank also asked: can we run an on-prem agent? They prefer Private deployment for data residency.

sachin (SRE): Private is possible but cadence is longer (security review + infra provisioning). For POC we can offer Private short-lived sandbox (requires infra lead + 2 weeks). Otherwise Dedicated in their cloud VPC is faster (1 week).

ellen (Prod): I've attached a short checklist for POC options: Dedicated-fasttrack vs Private-onprem. (I'll DM the doc).

maria (AE): Great. Who owns the demo repo and timeline? We need a customer-ready demo in 10 business days.

devon (SE): I'll own the demo repo and first draft by EOD +3. james will add the SDK change for call_id. sachin will scope Private/Dedicated infra and provide ETA. ellen will produce the cost estimate. I'll set a follow-up call with BigBank for Thursday.

james (Eng): Confirmed. I'll open a PR with the streaming call_id prop and a test harness.

maria (AE): Thanks all — I'll update the customer and attach the questionnaire. meeting scheduled Thu 10:30am. :thumbsup:
